{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_55648","headline":"永明山居诗（六十九首） 四十六 · 延寿","name":"永明山居诗（六十九首） 四十六","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"负气争权事可悲，金貂綉毂尽何之。\n唯闻野棘盘荒冢，只见空陵叠坏碑，灯暗竹堂行道夜，烟昏石窟坐禅时，怡然自得真栖处，何用经营别路歧。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"延寿","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_55648.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_55648","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}